--
-- Visuals: if ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Swords.<Id> exists (a Model with a "Handle" BasePart) it is used.
-- Otherwise SwordBuilder generates a procedural sword from the Visual table below, so every sword
-- is playable and distinct before final art exists.
--
-- Passive types (handled in CombatService):
--   DoT        { Damage, Ticks, Interval, Label }   burn / bleed / poison
--   Slow       { Mult, Duration }
--   Lifesteal  { Percent }
--   Chain      { Percent, Range }                   arcs to a second enemy
--   FinisherBoost { Bonus }                         extra finisher multiplier
--   Haste      { Mult }                             swing cooldown multiplier
--   Vulnerable { Mult, Duration }                   target takes more damage
--   Knockback  { Force }                            finisher launches target

